WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.797
Selling my women's bike, 28 inch, colour: dark green.

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:22.036
The bike is five years old but in very good condition. I always kept it in the cellar, so it is not rusty. Last month I bought new tyres and a new lamp. The brakes work perfectly.

00:00:22.286 --> 00:00:32.274
Why am I selling it? I am moving to Vienna in the summer and I am only taking one suitcase. Besides, there is a company bike at my new job.

00:00:32.524 --> 00:00:45.976
Price: 180 euros (or nearest offer). You are welcome to look at the bike at the weekend and take it for a test ride. Please send me a message or call in the evening.
